\title{Massimiliano Berti：Long Time Dynamics of Space Periodic Water Waves}
\date{2026-10-20}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Massimiliano Berti，Long Time Dynamics of Space Periodic Water Waves，载 Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，Volume 5: Invited Lectures (Sections 9–11)，213–233 页，SIAM，2026。在线发表日期为 2026-07-13。DOI：[10.1137/25M1802547](https://doi.org/10.1137/25M1802547)。[正式全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/full/10.1137/25M1802547)为本专题的版本依据；[arXiv:2512.22115v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.22115v1)是 2025-12-26 的预印本。}
\p{版权为 © 2026 International Mathematical Union，由 SIAM 以 [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 发布。本站[专题](4100)为中文改写、原子化重组及补充基础计算，保留原作者署名；没有复制原文插图。正式报告的许可不自动覆盖它引用的其他论文。}
\p{报告第 1 节讨论准周期驻波与行波，第 2 节讨论长时存在与 Hamilton Birkhoff 正规形，第 3 节讨论 Stokes 波调制不稳定。主要研究证明分别见：Baldi–Berti–Haus–Montalto，Time quasi-periodic gravity water waves in finite depth，Inventiones 214 (2018)，739–911，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00222-018-0812-2)；Berti–Franzoi–Maspero，Pure gravity traveling quasi-periodic water waves with constant vorticity，CPAM 77 (2024)，990–1064，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1002/cpa.22143)。}
\p{正规形的主要来源为 Berti–Maspero–Murgante，Hamiltonian Birkhoff normal form for gravity-capillary water waves with constant vorticity: Almost global existence，Annals of PDE 10 (2024)，22，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s40818-024-00182-z)；纯重力的四次正规形见 Berti–Feola–Pusateri，CPAM 76 (2023)，1416–1494，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1002/cpa.22041)。}
\p{谱不稳定来源为 Berti–Maspero–Ventura：深水 Benjamin–Feir 谱，Inventiones 230 (2022)，651–711，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00222-022-01130-z)；有限深谱，ARMA 247 (2023)，91，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00205-023-01916-2)，临界系数另见 [arXiv:2204.00809v1](https://arxiv.org/html/2204.00809v1) 的 (1.1)–(1.2)；临界深度不稳定，CMP 405 (2024)，56，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-023-04928-x)；深水第一个高频谱岛，EMS Surveys 12 (2025)，79–122，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.4171/emss/91)。}
\p{有限阶高频谱岛采用 Berti–Corsi–Maspero–Ventura，[Infinitely many isolas of modulational instability for Stokes waves，arXiv:2405.05854v1](https://arxiv.org/html/2405.05854v1)，2024-05-09，定理 1.1–1.2；该版本标注 CC BY 4.0。毛细驻波背景见 Berti–Montalto，[arXiv:1602.02411v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.02411v1)，后发表于 Memoirs AMS 263 (2020)，1273，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1090/memo/1273)。}
